log",prompt_value:$R[3473]={en:"clean catalog-ready fit with crisp garment details and balanced proportions",zh:"适合商品图的干净试衣效果，服装细节清晰，比例协调"}},$R[3474]={label:$R[3475]={en:"Editorial",zh:"时尚大片"},value:"editorial_styling",prompt_value:$R[3476]={en:"polished fashion editorial styling while keeping the same person and pose",zh:"更精致的时尚大片式造型，但保持同一人物和姿态"}}],default:"natural_fit",visible_when:$R[3477]={__advanced_try_on_controls:!0}},$R[3478]={name:"background_mode",type:"buttons",label:$R[3479]={en:"Background",zh:"背景"},values:$R[3480]=[$R[3481]={label:$R[3482]={en:"Keep",zh:"保留背景"},value:"keep_original",prompt_value:$R[3483]={en:"keep the original background, perspective, and lighting environment",zh:"保留原始背景、透视和光线环境"}},$R[3484]={label:$R[3485]={en:"Studio",zh:"干净影棚"},value:"clean_studio",prompt_value:$R[3486]={en:"use a clean neutral studio background while preserving the person pose and realistic shadows",zh:"使用干净中性的影棚背景，同时保留人物姿势和真实阴影"}}],default:"keep_original"},$R[3487]={name:"custom_direction",type:"textarea",label:$R[3488]={en:"Extra Direction",zh:"补充要求"},default:"Keep the final result realistic and do not alter the face.",required:!1,placeholder:$R[3489]={en:"Example: keep the shoes unchanged, make the jacket slightly oversized.",zh:"例如：鞋子保持不变，外套略宽松。"}}],description:$R[3490]={en:"Upload your photo and a garment or outfit reference to preview the look on you.",zh:"上传你的照片和衣服或目标模特参考图，预览换装后的效果。"},sub_mode_id:"image_to_image",default_model:"openai/gpt-image-2",prompt_template:$R[3491]={template:$R[3492]={en:"Edit the uploaded person photo using the outfit reference image. The first uploaded image is the person to keep. The second uploaded image is the garment, clothing item, or target-model outfit reference. Reference type: {{vars.reference_type}}. Garment scope: {{vars.garment_category}}. Fit direction: {{vars.fit_style}}. Background direction: {{vars.background_mode}}. Additional direction: {{custom_direction}} Preserve the person identity, face, facial features, skin tone, hairstyle, expression, body shape, pose, camera angle, and original photo realism. Replace only the visible clothing in the selected garment scope. Transfer the reference outfit color, pattern, material, texture, silhouette, neckline, sleeves, length, buttons, logos or text, accessories when relevant, and layering. If the reference image contains another model, use only that model clothing or outfit as the source; do not copy the reference model face, body, pose, age, hair, or background. Fit the clothing naturally to the person with realistic drape, seams, folds, body contact, occlusion around arms, hair, hands and accessories, and matching shadows, lighting, and color temperature. Keep hands, face, hair, background objects, and non-clothing areas unchanged unless the background direction explicitly asks for a clean studio background. Output one photorealistic virtual try-on image suitable for ecommerce preview, styling review, wardrobe planning, or social shopping.",zh:"根据上传的服装参考图编辑用户照片。第一张上传图片是需要保留的人物照片，第二张上传图片是衣服、单品或目标模特穿搭参考图。参考图类型：{{vars.reference_type}}。服装范围：{{vars.garment_category}}。试衣效果：{{vars.fit_style}}。背景处理：{{vars.background_mode}}。补充要求：{{custom_direction}} 保留人物身份、五官、脸型、肤色、发型、表情、体型、姿势、镜头角度和原照片真实感。只替换所选服装范围内可见的衣物。准确迁移参考穿搭的颜色、图案、材质、纹理、版型、领口、袖型、长度、纽扣、标志或文字、相关配饰和层次关系。如果参考图中有其他模特，只使用该模特身上的服装或穿搭作为来源，不要复制参考模特的脸、体型、姿势、年龄、发型或背景。让衣服自然贴合用户身体，呈现真实垂坠、接缝、褶皱、身体接触、手臂/头发/手部/配饰处的遮挡关系，并匹配阴影、光线和色温。除非背景处理明确要求影棚背景，否则保持手部、脸、头发、背景物体和非服装区域不变。输出一张适合电商预览、穿搭评审、衣橱规划或社交购物的写实换装试衣图。"}},model_options_override:$R[3493]={fixed:$R[3494]={resolution:"1K",aspect_ratio:"3:4"},hidden:$R[3495]=["resolution","aspect_ratio"]}}],sharing:$R[3496]={enable_share:!0,default_public:!1,enable_download:!0,enable_copy_protection:!1}},pricing:null,status:"active",isFeatured:!1,sort:20,viewCount:373,generationCount:88,totalCreditsConsumed:19,createdBy:null,createdAt:"2026-07-03T07:55:55.950Z",updatedAt:"2026-10-14T05:45:51.243Z"},appName:"AI Virtual Try-On",appDescription:"Preview clothes on your own ph